# Play case smoke (welcome → one case)

## Rule

Before telling Steve the **main game** is ready, agents must run the full welcome → case pass and **share screenshot paths** (or paste images in chat).

```powershell
Set-Location C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game
npm run dev   # includes smoke:play-case at end of start-dev.mjs
# or, servers already up:
npm run smoke:play-case
```

## Flow (Playwright)

1. Welcome plate (`01-welcome.png`)
2. Continue as physician (`02-after-physician.png` if first run)
3. Welcome HUD ready (`03-welcome-ready.png`)
4. **Play** nav → random case → Briefing (`04-briefing.png`)
5. **Begin case →** → Play scene with life bar + dock (`05-play-scene.png`)

Output: `docs/smoke-screenshots/<YYYY-MM-DD>/play-case/`

## Pair with differential smoke

| Script | Path |
|--------|------|
| Differentials | `docs/smoke-screenshots/<date>/01-welcome.png` … `06-floating-chat-open.png` |
| **Play case** | `docs/smoke-screenshots/<date>/play-case/*.png` |

Both run from `npm run dev` — do not skip.

## Common failures this catches

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `inferPatientSex is not defined` | Import in `src/data/gameData.js` |
| `allCaseIds is not defined` | `WelcomeScreen.handlePlay` fallback |
| Play click does nothing | Stale Vite — `node scripts/free-dev-ports.mjs` + `npm run dev` |
| White / black screen | `npm run smoke:pre-serve` (vite build) |

Optional API 500s on portrait/scene assets are ignored in console filter if play scene mounts.
